package todo

const WriteDescription = "Read or atomically edit the current TODO board. Call with {} to refresh the complete board. todos contains incremental edits: omit id to create (subject required, status defaults to pending), or supply an existing id to update only specified fields. Omitted tasks and fields are retained; empty arrays do nothing. deleteIds explicitly removes tasks and their links. Both creation and updates accept priority, owner, metadata and dependencies. blocks/blockedBy replace the specified dependency list and maintain reciprocal links; IDs must exist before this call. Self-dependencies, cycles and starting blocked work are rejected. Metadata merges top-level keys; null removes a key. Teammates claim in_progress tasks under their own name. Returns boardId, todos with IDs and DONE completed/total progress. Track complex work; this tool never launches an Agent or a background task."
